@startuml UseCase_A_CreateObject
title Use Case A: 創建物件 (Creating an object)
note top: 規格: 使用者先點擊Rect或Oval按鈕，然後在Canvas上拖曳建立物件

actor User
participant __aUMLEditor__ as UMLEditor
participant __aCanvas__ as Canvas
participant __aCreateObjectMode__ as CreateObjectMode
participant __aRectFactory__    as ShapeFactory
participant __aBasicObject__ as BasicObject
'participant __SelectMode__ as SelectMode

== Step 1: 點擊Rect按鈕 ==

User -> UMLEditor ++ : 1. 在Rect或Oval按鈕上按下左鍵

UMLEditor -> UMLEditor ++ : 原模式按鈕顏色復原(變白色)
UMLEditor -->> UMLEditor -- : return
UMLEditor -> UMLEditor ++ : 2. 目標Rect/Oval按鈕變黑
UMLEditor -->> UMLEditor -- : return

User -> UMLEditor : 3. 放開左鍵

UMLEditor -> Canvas ++ : setCurrentMode(CreateObjectMode)
Canvas -->> UMLEditor -- : return
UMLEditor -->> User -- : return

== Step 2: 在Canvas上拖曳建立物件 ==

User -> Canvas ++ : 4. 在Canvas上按下左鍵(不放開)

Canvas -> CreateObjectMode ++ : mousePressed(MouseEvent)
CreateObjectMode -> CreateObjectMode ++ : startPoint = 座標\npreviewBox初始化
CreateObjectMode -->> CreateObjectMode -- : return
CreateObjectMode -->> Canvas -- : return

User -> Canvas : 5. 拖曳滑鼠(drag)

Canvas -> CreateObjectMode ++ : mouseDragged(MouseEvent)
CreateObjectMode -> CreateObjectMode ++ : 更新previewBox大小與位置
CreateObjectMode -->> CreateObjectMode -- : return
CreateObjectMode -> Canvas ++ : repaint()
Canvas -->> CreateObjectMode -- : return
CreateObjectMode -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas : 顯示灰色預覽框(拖曳軌跡)

User -> Canvas : 6. 放開左鍵(mouse released)

Canvas -> CreateObjectMode ++ : mouseReleased(MouseEvent)
CreateObjectMode -> ShapeFactory ++ : orderShape(x, y, width, height)
ShapeFactory -> ShapeFactory ++ : createShape(x, y) [工廠方法]
ShapeFactory -> BasicObject ++ : new BasicObject(x, y, ObjectType.RECT)
BasicObject -->> ShapeFactory -- : return
ShapeFactory -->> ShapeFactory -- : return BasicObject
ShapeFactory -> BasicObject ++ : setBounds(x, y, width, height)
BasicObject -->> ShapeFactory -- : return
ShapeFactory -->> CreateObjectMode -- : return BasicObject
CreateObjectMode -> Canvas ++ : addShape(basicObject)
Canvas -->> CreateObjectMode -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 7. 在畫布區內繪製Rect或Oval物件
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : repaint()
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return
CreateObjectMode -> Canvas ++ : returnToDefaultMode()
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : setCurrentMode(defaultMode = SelectMode)
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> UMLEditor ++ : onModeChanged(SelectMode) [模式變更事件]
UMLEditor -> UMLEditor ++ : 8. highlightActiveButton(): 其他按鈕復原, Select按鈕變黑
UMLEditor -->> UMLEditor -- : return
UMLEditor -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -->> CreateObjectMode -- : return

@enduml